<title>USA: Landstar System Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Landstar System Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SHELTON, Conn. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>LANDSTAR SYSTEM INC.</p>
<p>	    (Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>		   Thirty-Nine Weeks Ended   Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>			9/28/96	9/30/95     9/28/96    9/30/95</p>
<p> Revenue	    $954,784    $902,535    $330,195   $298,681</p>
<p> Net income	   17,862	19,753	 7,694	7,176</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>			    1.40	  1.54	  0.60	 0.56</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>		    12,783,000  12,816,000  12,788,000 12,778,000</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
